## Change under review

The reviewer sometimes proposes the same defect twice, which costs a second investigation and a second triage for one problem. Candidates in the same file with the same issue_type and overlapping line ranges are now merged before investigation, with the narrowest claim surviving. Overlap is tested with the evaluator's existing line tolerance.

